              "content": "Activity 1 :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " From the Table 13.3 find the mean by taking each of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "x _ { i }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (i.e., 17.5, 32.5, and so on) as "
